# Pinned Yarn dependencies

Add dependencies with `yarn add` from the repo root.

Do not use `forge install`, `npm install`, or `pnpm add` to add a dependency.

Every direct dependency in `package.json` is an exact version. No `^`, `~`, `*`, or `>=`. Do not loosen an existing exact pin back into a range.

```bash
# Bad
forge install OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts
yarn add ethers

# Good
yarn add ethers@6.15.0 --exact
```

```json
// Bad
"ethers": "^6.15.0"

// Good
"ethers": "6.15.0"
```
